{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20985","headline":"秋凉诗寄正字十二兄 · 李贺","name":"秋凉诗寄正字十二兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闭门感秋风，幽姿任契阔。\n大野生素空，天地旷肃杀。\n露光泣残蕙，虫响连夜发。\n房寒寸辉薄，迎风绦纱折。\n披书古芸馥，恨唱华容歇。\n百日不相知，花光变凉节。\n弟兄谁念虑，牋翰既通达。\n青袍度白马，草简奏东阙。\n梦中相聚笑，觉见半牀月。\n长思剧寻环，乱忧抵覃葛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}